AIP                                                                          GEN 3.6-5
BANGLADESH                                                                   05 OCT 2023



   5.4 List of Rescue Units of Bangladesh:

     a)   All Army units in Bangladesh;
     b) All Air Force Units in Bangladesh;
     c)   All Naval and Coast Guard Units in Bangladesh;
     d)   Bangladesh Fire service and Civil defense Headquarters, Dhaka;
     e)   All Fire stations in Bangladesh;
     f)   All police Stations in Bangladesh;
     g) All Border Guard Bangladesh Units;
     h) ALL BIWTC and BIWTC offices in Bangladesh;
     i)   Mercantile Marine and Port Authorities;
     j)   All RAB Units in Bangladesh.




CIVIL AVIATION AUTHORITY                                                   AIP AMDT 03/23
